    "detailed_description": "&quot;MythicZon is a charming 3D game that combines survival, zombie combat, and resource management. In this game, you'll encounter a terrifying world overrun by zombies, and your goal is to survive while battling hordes of the undead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSurvival: Stay alert and avoid zombie wandering. Use survival skills to endure day and night.<br />\r\nWeapons and Upgrades: Collect different weapons, including rifles, pistols, and grenades. Upgrade your arsenal to enhance its effectiveness against zombies.<br />\r\nUnlocking Doors and Collecting Currency: Explore the surrounding areas, unlock closed doors, and search for money and resources. Some areas may require you to unlock doors to access new areas.<br />\r\nBase Development: Build a sturdy base to survive. Upgrade buildings and enhance security to protect yourself from zombie attacks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMythicZon offers an entertaining and immersive experience. Are you ready to face the horror and challenges? \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udd2b&quot;",
